WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:03.767
Albert Woodfox
had four decades

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.667
in solitary confinement.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.567
He was imprisoned here in
Angola State Penitentiary

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.800
for most of his life.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.400
But it was an incident
a year after his arrival

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.200
in Angola that would change
the course of Albert's life.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.900
A prison guard was
found murdered.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.333
Albert believes he
and two other inmates

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.400
were framed because
of their affiliation

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.700
with the Black Panthers.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.900
They became known
as the Angola Three.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.000
Well, the Angola Three
consists of myself,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.600
Herman Wallace, who
passed away in 2013,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.934
and Robert Hillary King.

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:44.066
We, you know, joined
the Black Panther Party

00:00:44.066 --> 00:00:46.800
while I was still in prison.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.066
We became politically active.

00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:52.533
We campaigned and
waged various protests

00:00:52.533 --> 00:01:01.233
against institutional racism,
sexual slavery, brutality

00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:06.200
and death by security staff
and prisoners upon one another

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.834
as a result of them,
you know, having

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:12.467
a low level of consciousness
as to what was going on.

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:17.367
On his 69th birthday,
after 43 years and 10 months

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:21.834
in solitary, Albert Woodfox
became the last of the Angola

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:24.333
Three to be released.

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:29.433
Albert's body finally
followed his mind to freedom.

00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:33.000
I have four beautiful
great-grandkids now,

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.033
and I would like them to be
judged on their abilities,

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:42.967
you know, not their ethnicity
or the color or the skin or hair

00:01:42.967 --> 00:01:45.667
textures or physical features.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:50.500
You know, I would not want
them 10, 15, 20 years from now

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.467
to be fighting the
same battles that I've

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:55.533
been fighting most of my life.

